    "name": "Living Benefit Rider effect on contract",
    "text": "Effect On Contract The following values will be reduced by the Proportion at the time the payment is made to you: 1. the future planned premium payable on the basic policy; the face amount of the policy at the time of claim; the cash value (policy value); any remaining surrender charge; the cash surrender value; and Oo PWN any policy debt including any unpaid loan interest."
  },
